bin/
obj/
out/
**/Debug/
**/Release/
**/x64/
**/x86/
**/build/

# Visual Studio files
.vs/
*.user
*.rsuser
*.suo
*.cache
*.pdb
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

# NuGet packages
*.nupkg
**/packages/*
!**/packages/build/
*.snupkg

# Logs
*.log

# Publish output
wwwroot/
.publish/
project.lock.json

# Other .NET
*.dbmdl
*.jfm
*.cache/
Generated_Code/

